  "protocolVersion": null,
  "instructions": "Use these tools to manage Cliniweb appointments, patients, doctors, public profiles, and user accounts. Most tools require Cliniweb credentials passed as request headers (X-Cliniweb-Domain, X-Cliniweb-Username, X-Cliniweb-Password) or a pre-issued bearer token (X-Cliniweb-Token). For stdio transport, the equivalent CLINIWEB_* environment variables are read instead. Recommended workflow: search before mutating (cliniweb_pacientes_search before cliniweb_pacientes_update); use cliniweb_citas_available_slots to find a slot before calling cliniweb_citas_create; list catalogs (cliniweb_catalogos_*, cliniweb_doctores_list) to obtain valid foreign-key ids before creating appointments.",
